      "title": "Understanding versus delivery",
      "sample_plain": "8 meeting prefixes, 2 models and 2 contexts; 32 recognition calls. Two meetings also had 3 paired continuation branches each.",
      "finding_plain": "Saved history reduced diagnostic passes for both models. A correct need summary improved one meeting from 1 to 2 of 3 delivered conclusions; the other stayed at zero.",
      "limits": [
        "Diagnostic context comparison is not a full-harness benchmark.",
        "The correct summaries were supplied for diagnosis, not generated by an implemented memory method.",
        "Six continuation branches did not achieve complete help; only two independent meetings were tested."
      ],
