      "title": "Short intention scenarios",
      "sample_plain": "6 short scenarios, 2 repeats each; 12 baseline runs with Qwen2.5 14B.",
      "finding_plain": "Required help succeeded in 6 of 8 runs, or 5 under the stricter evidence reading. Both multi-question runs found answers but never published them.",
      "limits": [
        "Cancellation and silence controls are separate from required-help success.",
        "One evidence-boundary judgement changes 6 of 8 to 5 of 8; this is not a confidence interval.",
        "Synthetic short replay; no real ASR, long-term memory or user-benefit claim."
      ],
      "method_notes": [
        "The frozen project baseline ran unchanged against controlled documents for 45 simulated seconds per scenario.",
        "Two independent AI reviews and trace adjudication preserved the evidence-boundary disagreement."
